54	     * {@code registrationDate}: {@code 'MINOR'} when the owner is under 18 on the registration date,
55	     * {@code 'ADULT'} from 18 up to and including 64, and {@code 'SENIOR'} at 65 or over. Returns
56	     * {@code null} when either the birth date or the registration date is absent.
